module noskip (some true)
a: record in the branch (t): full localLog [fromBranch], syncLog [fromBranch], cacheLog [fromBranch], main localLog []; kept reads equal; stateOnly #[]
b: empty record, main-branch write after the fork (t2): full localLog [], syncLog [], cacheLog [], main localLog [mainSide]; kept reads equal; stateOnly #[]
